<view class="page"><view class="title">内容工作台</view><view class="notice">仅云端管理员可操作。动作、食物与模板在发布前需由具备相关专业能力的人员审核。</view><view wx:if="{{!authorized}}" class="card empty">尚未取得管理员权限，请配置云环境与管理员名单。<button class="secondary space" bindtap="load">重新验证</button></view><block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="row"><text>编辑内容版本</text><button class="link" bindtap="sample">从当前库新建</button></view><input class="space" placeholder="版本号：仅字母、数字、横线" value="{{version}}" data-field="version" bindinput="input"/><textarea style="height:600rpx" class="space" maxlength="200000" value="{{editor}}" data-field="editor" bindinput="input" placeholder="内容 JSON（exercises、foods、source）"/><button class="dark space" bindtap="save">保存草稿</button></view><view wx:for="{{versions}}" wx:key="version" class="card"><view class="row"><text>{{item.version}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.status}}</text></view><button class="link space" data-version="{{item.version}}" bindtap="view">查看内容</button><view class="actions"><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'draft'}}" class="secondary" data-version="{{item.version}}" data-status="reviewed" bindtap="transition">标记已审核</button><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'reviewed'}}" class="dark" data-version="{{item.version}}" data-status="published" bindtap="transition">发布</button><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'published'}}" class="danger" data-version="{{item.version}}" data-status="disabled" bindtap="transition">停用</button></view></view></block></view>
